  "analysis": "Resizing to 50% didn't help speed and degraded OCR quality. The background OCR of 5fps frames is running. Meanwhile, let me work on improving the 1fps parser. I need to look at consecutive frames' full text to understand how scrollback accumulates and write a better parser that properly tracks command order.",
